{"id":"n55751-1-5","stage":4,"title":"모금 · 口","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55751-1-5-1","ko":"술 한 잔 하시겠어요?","zh":"要喝一杯酒吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔","meaning":"酒杯","explanation":"잔：酒杯","readings":[{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17371","senseId":"2","lemma":"잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시겠어요?","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个，同一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"同一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"ca06065856b9c29b","term":"잔","zh":"酒杯","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3","entryId":"17371","definition":"倒酒喝的小器具。","pronunciation":["잔"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进食或抽烟等。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7424f01c2852b4d0785.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55751-1-5-2","ko":"괜찮아요. 저는 와인 한 모금만 마셔도 금세 취해서요.","zh":"不用了，我喝一小口葡萄酒都很快会醉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아요.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와인","meaning":"红酒，葡萄酒","explanation":"와인：红酒，葡萄酒","readings":[{"term":"와인","audio":"/audio/0b5661b6eebdebf773fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67845","senseId":"1","lemma":"와인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모금만","meaning":"口","explanation":"모금：口；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"모금","audio":"/audio/192ef62bf0fd3efb7080.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55751","senseId":"1","lemma":"모금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마셔도","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금세","meaning":"马上，立马，立刻","explanation":"금세：马上，立马，立刻","readings":[{"term":"금세","audio":"/audio/fb465f58ee09787d0a63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37206","senseId":"1","lemma":"금세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"취해서요.","meaning":"醉","explanation":"취하다：醉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"취하다","audio":"/audio/bace132cddc63e17f409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66313","senseId":"1","lemma":"취하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"0b5661b6eebdebf7","term":"와인","zh":"红酒，葡萄酒","audio":"/audio/0b5661b6eebdebf773fb.mp3","entryId":"67845","definition":"发酵葡萄汁制成的洋酒。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个，同一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"同一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"192ef62bf0fd3efb","term":"모금","zh":"口","audio":"/audio/192ef62bf0fd3efb7080.mp3","entryId":"55751","definition":"计算口中一次能含的液体或气体的分量时使用的单位。","pronunciation":["모금"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"fb465f58ee09787d","term":"금세","zh":"马上，立马，立刻","audio":"/audio/fb465f58ee09787d0a63.mp3","entryId":"37206","definition":"时间过不了多久。","pronunciation":["금세"]},{"id":"bace132cddc63e17","term":"취하다","zh":"醉","audio":"/audio/bace132cddc63e17f409.mp3","entryId":"66313","definition":"由于酒劲或药劲而精神恍惚，身体无法正常行动。","pronunciation":["취ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd4c282ada0dde20af7d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55751","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.9013,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不用了，我喝一小口葡萄酒都很快会醉。","要喝一杯酒吗？","你跑得那么急匆匆的，要去哪儿啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["要喝一杯酒吗？","你跑得那么急匆匆的，要去哪儿啊？","不用了，我喝一小口葡萄酒都很快会醉。"],"answer":2}]}
